repository-code: 'https://github.com/answerrai/SLPT'
url: 'https://github.com/answerrai/SLPT'
abstract: >-
  An open specification and JSON Schema (Draft 2020-12) for
  Learning Provenance Records: a portable, machine-checkable
  record format for learner-AI interaction. SLPT records the
  provenance of an interaction, not of a learner's knowledge.
  Schema conformance does not establish measurement validity.
